  "articleBody": "Start a guest bathroom remodel by documenting the room, defining how guests will use it, and setting a realistic scope before selecting finishes. Confirm the layout, plumbing and electrical changes, ventilation plan, materials, approvals, construction responsibilities, and final inspection expectations with the remodeling provider before demolition begins.",
